  "question": {
    "text": "The time period (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>) of small oscillations of the surface of a liquid drop depends on its surface tension (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi></math>), the density (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ρ</mi></math>) of the liquid and it's mean radius (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>) as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"> <mrow> <mi>T</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mi>c</mi> <mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace> <msup> <mi>s</mi> <mi>x</mi> </msup> <msup> <mi>ρ</mi> <mi>y</mi> </msup> <msup> <mi>r</mi> <mi>z</mi></msup></mrow></math>. If in the measurement of the mean radius of the drop, the error is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>%,</mo></math>&nbsp;the error in the measurement of surface tension and density both are of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. Find the percentage error in measurement of the time period.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p> <math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>z</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math> </p><p> <math><semantics><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi></msup><msup><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>r</mi><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi></msup><msup><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mi>z</mi></msup><mo accent=\"false\">⇒</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> </p><p> <math><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mo accent=\"false\">⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">  </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">  </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> , <math><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> </p><p> <math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mi>s</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo accent=\"false\">⇒</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">ΔT</mtext><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">Δρ</mtext><mi>ρ</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">Δr</mtext><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">Δs</mtext><mi>s</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> </p'>",
